    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/7b8effb4c4cbd2982aff3a7896715835.poster.avif?t=1755091762\" width=700 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/7b8effb4c4cbd2982aff3a7896715835.webm?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/7b8effb4c4cbd2982aff3a7896715835.mp4?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sucks To Be In The Sticks is a game where the supernatural bleeds into the personal. You play as 19-year-old Ilo, whose life is turned upside down when they become a vampire. You\u2019ll uncover the stories of small, everyday people \u2014 the things they won\u2019t say out loud, or even admit to themselves. Each time you drink human blood or energy, you experience their darkest moments or unlikely dreams through emotional mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/2e3dce288b5bbf348c75509e26473902.poster.avif?t=1755091762\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/2e3dce288b5bbf348c75509e26473902.webm?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/2e3dce288b5bbf348c75509e26473902.mp4?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore all that your vampire life has to offer, try to hold on to what remains of your humanity: have late-night conversations with your mom while helping her at the flower shop, navigate a childhood friendship strained by your new secret, work odd jobs and spend your earnings on feeding stray cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/26de344755af628a5dff790e132ed83c.poster.avif?t=1755091762\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/26de344755af628a5dff790e132ed83c.webm?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/26de344755af628a5dff790e132ed83c.mp4?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet diverse characters too often overlooked in small-town settings \u2014 queer people, ethnic minorities, migrants. The game engages with social and political issues through both metaphor and realism: how structures punish autonomy, suppress empathy, and erase resistance. You\u2019ll witness the efforts of local activists, power struggles behind closed doors, and ultimately find your place in this strange, broken world. The game art captures the bleakness and beauty of a dying town that many will find hauntingly familiar. STBITS invites you into the full spectrum of (non)human life \u2014 pain, comedy, fear, joy, love. To survive, its characters must laugh at the absurd, sit with their grief, and find hope where none was meant to be.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/7b8effb4c4cbd2982aff3a7896715835.poster.avif?t=1755091762\" width=700 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/7b8effb4c4cbd2982aff3a7896715835.webm?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/7b8effb4c4cbd2982aff3a7896715835.mp4?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sucks To Be In The Sticks is a game where the supernatural bleeds into the personal. You play as 19-year-old Ilo, whose life is turned upside down when they become a vampire. You\u2019ll uncover the stories of small, everyday people \u2014 the things they won\u2019t say out loud, or even admit to themselves. Each time you drink human blood or energy, you experience their darkest moments or unlikely dreams through emotional mini-games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/2e3dce288b5bbf348c75509e26473902.poster.avif?t=1755091762\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/2e3dce288b5bbf348c75509e26473902.webm?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/2e3dce288b5bbf348c75509e26473902.mp4?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore all that your vampire life has to offer, try to hold on to what remains of your humanity: have late-night conversations with your mom while helping her at the flower shop, navigate a childhood friendship strained by your new secret, work odd jobs and spend your earnings on feeding stray cats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/26de344755af628a5dff790e132ed83c.poster.avif?t=1755091762\" width=700 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/26de344755af628a5dff790e132ed83c.webm?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665100/extras/26de344755af628a5dff790e132ed83c.mp4?t=1755091762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ll meet diverse characters too often overlooked in small-town settings \u2014 queer people, ethnic minorities, migrants. The game engages with social and political issues through both metaphor and realism: how structures punish autonomy, suppress empathy, and erase resistance. You\u2019ll witness the efforts of local activists, power struggles behind closed doors, and ultimately find your place in this strange, broken world. The game art captures the bleakness and beauty of a dying town that many will find hauntingly familiar. STBITS invites you into the full spectrum of (non)human life \u2014 pain, comedy, fear, joy, love. To survive, its characters must laugh at the absurd, sit with their grief, and find hope where none was meant to be.</p>",
    "short_description": "The vampire who turned you cursed you with a cruel hunger: while others live on human energy, only blood can truly sustain you. Drinking it drags you into strangers\u2019 deepest sorrows - visions that will haunt you soon enough. Keep saving others if you must, but don\u2019t lose yourself.",
